# Paths kept in git but NOT published to GitHub Pages.
#
# The deploy workflow (.github/workflows/static.yml) deletes these from its
# throwaway checkout right before uploading the site artifact. The files stay
# in the repository, so `git clone` and `git pull` still bring them down. They
# simply never reach mglearn.github.io.
#
# IMPORTANT, and worth saying plainly: this hides files from the *website*, not
# from GitHub. This repository is public, so anything listed here is still
# readable by anyone at github.com/mglearn/tcea and through raw.githubusercontent
# URLs. Do not treat this as a place for secrets. The only ways to get real
# privacy are to make the repository private or to keep the files out of it.
#
# One path per line. Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored.
# Paths are relative to the repository root. No absolute paths, no "..".

pspoll/internal
